WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Supplier comparison. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Compare complete like-for-like quotes

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Supplier quotes need the same specification, quantity, delivery, tax and included service to be comparable.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: A $90 part with $40 shipping is not cheaper than a $115 delivered quote on the same quantity basis.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Quote audit

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Compare complete like-for-like quotes
